      font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">PC 28.175  Six Ray Mixed</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">by Walt Heitland &amp; Dan Mooney</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">For Corundum or higher materials.</text>
